CLEAN-ROOM STATEMENT
All Fuses, macros, shaders (GPU kernels), reference pixel functions and generators in this package were written from scratch for this project.
Several effects (bevel / emboss, reflection, page curl, glow) were INSPIRED by the behaviour of third-party effect packs the author owns, studied as
black boxes (what the controls do and how the result looks). No code, node graphs, expressions, control names, layouts or assets from those packs were
copied; the algorithms here (Gaussian-derivative relief gather, mirror + growing blur, cylinder curl model, pyramid glow) are independent implementations
of well-known techniques. See docs/CLEAN_ROOM.md for the review.

